<title>ESTONIA: SANGAR TO ISSUE SHARES, SEEK BOURSE LISTING.</title>
<headline>SANGAR TO ISSUE SHARES, SEEK BOURSE LISTING.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sangar, a clothing manufacturer, is to organise a public share in September, investment house Talinvest said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;Sangar will order a share issue to start in the middle of September,&quot; Henrik Igasta, head of corporate finance for Talinvest, told Reuters.</p>
<p>Talinvest will organise Sangar's share issue but the final details of the issue have not been released as yet.</p>
<p>&quot;Sangar will seek a listing on the secondary list of the Tallinn stock exchange after the issue,&quot; he added.</p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9202 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
